    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78b802462501e41fb22da0d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在她决心重新编织圆环而奋起的第二天。\n创升召集了赛马娘们以及工作人员\n召开了一场紧急会议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeade8d88e0f7c1bc74e5824047fb207f76a8cc8b81bd6909560f342248a2ef7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143116.json",
      "json_path": [
