      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，即便现在回到仍处混乱的日本，\n我们能做到的事情……想必少之又少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d725bcb9f61205eea661fada271c139a248fb1680c1f74fd0cdda78061adbec1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
